* Iron Atgeir can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with an [[Iron Battle Idol]].

== Notes ==
* The secondary attack is enough to stagger most creatures.

== Trivia ==
* Historically, no archeological find has been made to establish the existence of this weapon. The [[wikipedia:Atgeir|atgeir]] is only mentioned in one of the Icelandic sagas, composed at the end of the 13th century. This could mean that the weapon was, in fact, based upon 13th century [[wikipedia:Pole_weapon|polearms]] (thus the weapon's category name used in ''Valheim''), before being retroactively attributed to the Viking period.

